地点是在“激情套餐厅”。

1135
01:03:46.230 --> 01:03:46.670
Wow.
哇。

1136
01:03:47.470 --> 01:03:55.630
I can tell you that we filmed all of these rehearsal dinner scenes at the famous Smokehouse restaurant in Burbank.
我可以告诉大家，我们是在伯班克著名的烟屋餐厅拍摄了所有这些彩排晚宴的场景。

1137
01:03:56.130 --> 01:04:02.070
I don't know if you remember, Angela, but at the time, I lived in walking distance from the Smokehouse.
安吉拉，我不记得你还记不记得，当时我就住在离烟屋餐厅步行可达的地方。

1138
01:04:02.310 --> 01:04:04.870
Oh, you were so excited when we were filming there.
哦，我们在那儿拍摄的时候你可兴奋了。

1139
01:04:04.870 --> 01:04:07.870
I would walk home for lunch and I'd have lunch with Lee.
我会走回家吃午饭，然后和李一起吃。

1140
01:04:08.650 --> 01:04:09.910
It was so great.
那真是太棒了。

1141
01:04:10.730 --> 01:04:14.070
And guys, listen, the Smokehouse is a very famous restaurant.
伙计们，听着，烟屋餐厅是一家非常有名的餐厅。

1142
01:04:14.290 --> 01:04:16.810
It is right across the street from Warner Brothers Studios.
它就在华纳兄弟制片厂的街对面。

1143
01:04:17.150 --> 01:04:21.410
