总之，这就是好莱坞的传说。

1147
01:04:33.970 --> 01:04:37.690
Well, the original Smokehouse only seated 46 people.
最初的烟屋餐厅只能容纳46个人。

1148
01:04:38.250 --> 01:04:41.510
I found a whole little video documentary about it.
我找到了一部关于它的完整纪录片。

1149
01:04:41.610 --> 01:04:45.410
And I thought we should listen to a little audio clip about its history.
我觉得我们应该听一段关于它历史的音频片段。

1150
01:04:45.850 --> 01:04:46.090
Great.
太好了。

1151
01:04:47.190 --> 01:04:53.810
The original Smokehouse was started here at Riverside and Pass in Burbank in 1946 by two Lockheed engineers,
最初的Smokehouse餐厅于1946年由两位洛克希德公司的工程师在伯班克的河滨路和帕斯路交汇处创立，

1152
01:04:54.270 --> 01:04:55.730
Jim Stockton and Jack Monroe.
他们是吉姆·斯托克顿和杰克·门罗。

1153
01:04:55.730 --> 01:04:59.170
Jim was the promoter and frontman and Jack was the cook.
吉姆负责推广和对外联络，杰克则负责掌勺。

1154
01:04:59.710 --> 01:05:04.170
Opening night was attended by such neighborhood luminaries as Bob Hope and Bing Crosby.
开业当晚，鲍勃·霍普和宾·克罗斯比等邻近社区的名流都出席了。

1155
01:05:04.690 --> 01:05:10.450
Soon after, all 46 seats were regularly filled to capacity and it was time to look for larger quarters.
不久之后，餐厅的46个座位就经常座无虚席，是时候寻找更大的店面了。

1156
01:05:10.910 --> 01:05:15.790
As fate would have it, the Red Coach Inn, built by Danny Kaye but never opened, was available
机缘巧合之下，由丹尼·凯建造但从未开业的红马车旅馆正好空了出来，

1157
01:05:15.790 --> 01:05:19.370
and in 1948 became the permanent home of the Smokehouse.
于是1948年，它成为了Smokehouse的永久店址。

1158
01:05:19.790 --> 01:05:23.310
By 1952, Jim's younger brother Stan was running the restaurant
到了1952年，吉姆的弟弟斯坦开始经营这家餐厅，

1159
01:05:23.310 --> 01:05:24.670
and Chef John L.
而主厨约翰·L·

